    "deviceInformationNote": "0x180A is present with all five characteristics readable (0x2A29, 0x2A24, 0x2A25, 0x2A27, 0x2A26) and the client issued ZERO Read Requests in either session. Manufacturer name, model number, serial, hardware revision and firmware revision are UNKNOWN for this unit and must not be carried over from the legacy Neo capture.",
