    "featureNote": "CP Feature (0x2A65), CSC Feature (0x2A5C) and Sensor Location (0x2A5D) are present and readable and were likewise never read. Their values are unknown.",
    "simulatorIdentityBlocked": "This fixture is sufficient to reproduce the Neo 2's advertisement and GATT SHAPE. It is NOT sufficient to create a simulator identity, because a persona must also serve DIS and feature READ values and this evidence supplies none. Resolve with one nRF Connect session reading 0x2A29/0x2A24/0x2A25/0x2A27/0x2A26/0x2A65/0x2A5C/0x2A5D against the same unit."
  },
